@title: login_admin
@context: The admin signs in, asks to be remembered, sees the admin role and signs out.
@tags: login
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the login page
    NAVIGATE to 'Login'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Login'

STEP 2: Type the username
    FILL 'Username' field with 'ada'
    VERIFY 'Username' field has value 'ada'

STEP 3: Type the password
    FILL 'Password' field with 'lovelace'
    VERIFY 'Password' field has value 'lovelace'

STEP 4: Ask to be remembered
    CHECK the checkbox for 'Remember me'
    VERIFY that 'Remember me' is checked

STEP 5: Sign in
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, ada' is present
    VERIFY 'Role' field has value 'admin'

STEP 6: Sign out
    CLICK the 'Logout' button
    VERIFY that the page is 'Login'
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, ada' is NOT present

STEP 7: Go home
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Home'

DONE.
